fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gstvp9parser.html#gst_vp9_parser_parse_frame_header","fragment":"\n\tgst_vp9_parser_parse_frame_header\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.Vp9Parser.prototype.parse_frame_header\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.Vp9Parser.parse_frame_header\n\nParses the VP9 bitstream contained in data, and fills in frame_hdr\nwith the information. The size argument represent the whole frame size.\nParameters:\nThe GstVp9Parser\nThe GstVp9FrameHdr to fill\nThe data to parse\nThe size of the data to parse\na GstVp9ParserResult\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.8\n\t\t\nParses the VP9 bitstream contained in data, and fills in frame_hdr\nwith the information. The size argument represent the whole frame size.\nParameters:\nThe GstCodecParsers.Vp9Parser\nThe GstCodecParsers.Vp9FrameHdr to fill\nThe data to parse\nThe size of the data to parse\na GstCodecParsers.Vp9ParserResult\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.8\n\t\t\nParses the VP9 bitstream contained in data, and fills in frame_hdr\nwith the information. The size argument represent the whole frame size.\nParameters:\nThe GstCodecParsers.Vp9Parser\nThe GstCodecParsers.Vp9FrameHdr to fill\nThe data to parse\nThe size of the data to parse\na GstCodecParsers.Vp9ParserResult\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.8\n\t\t\n"});